凉州\n有沦陷危机，但也不表示要将凉州拱手\n让人。\n&马隆\n凉州这个地方本来就不是我大魏可以完全\n掌握的地方。\n&马隆\n就算经过张既、徐邈等人辛苦经营了\n数十年，在蜀军兵锋下还是随时倒戈。\n&马隆\n加上州内多数异民族和汉人杂居，彼此\n产生的摩擦和怨恨，让凉州变得更难以\n统治。\n&马隆\n失去凉州对我们无所伤，对蜀也不见得\n有所得。\n&马隆\n但是如果消耗大量人力物力在这个地方，\n那才是我们最大的失策。\n&胡烈\n孝兴呀，你终究是不懂…或许以战略来说\n你是对的。\n&胡烈\n但是我把凉州拱手让给蜀人逃回洛阳，\n你认为我的下场会是如何？\n&胡烈\n轻则被冷冻处死，重则影响整个胡家的\n前途。\n&胡烈\n我打算战死在这里，至少这样可以让鹞鸱\n或是整个安定胡家可以获得保全。"]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[148,65535,3,0,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&胡渊\n爹，我要和您一起共存亡！\n&胡烈\n不许！你才十八岁，还有大好人生。不可\n以在这里浪费自己宝贵的生命。\n&胡烈\n两位太守也是，败战责任我来扛就行，\n你们想办法逃走吧。\n&杨欣\n呜呜呜…刺史呀…\n&杨欣\n（要死就快去死吧，不要拖累老子。）\n&牵弘\n我怎么忍心看见刺史您牺牲？\n&牵弘\n（快点牺牲吧，你这个没用的西凉人。）"]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[0,147,0,5,5,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&胡渊\n爹！\n&胡烈\n大魏凉州刺史胡烈在此！贼人快来受死！\n&若罗拔能\n受死？！哈哈哈哈哈，我看是你来送死\n吧。"]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[809,6,0,0]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[810,6,0,0]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[811,6,0,0]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[812,6,0,0]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[813,6,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[147,3,0,0]},{"op":35,"name":"play_music","args":[35,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[147,9,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&胡烈\n鹞鸱…希望你能坚强地活下去…"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":83,"name":"unit_op_53","args":[0,147,0,0,0,0,6,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[148,65535,0,0,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&胡渊\n该死的秃发树机能！还我爹来！\n&马隆\n请小将军不要这么冲动，现在送死的话\n怎么为父报仇，请多忍耐。"]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[148,65535,2,0,0,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&胡渊\n你闭嘴！如果不是你和爹唱反调，爹怎么\n会出兵？\n&马隆\n真是有理说不清，现在我们应该想着如何\n存活下去，而不是在这互相争辩。"]},{"op":77,"name":"unit_op_4d","args":[0,14,0,0,0,0,0,6,0,2,65535,0,0]},{"op":77,"name":"unit_op_4d","args":[0,14,0,0,0,0,0,6,1,2,65535,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[83]},{"op":25,"name":"victory_cond_text","args":["胜利条件\n一﹑全灭敌人。\n\n印授条件\n一、触发所有和马隆有关的剧情。\n\n失败条件\n一﹑姜维死亡。\n二、马隆死亡。\n三、回合数超过30。"]},{"op":26,"name":"battle_goal_text","args":["一﹑全灭敌人。�C"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["印授条件\n触发所有和马隆有关的剧情。"]},{"op":90,"name":"ui_5a","args":[]},{"op":8,"name":"set_result","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]},{"index":1,"offset":16998,"sections":[{"index":0,"offset":17000,"title":"ね瓁北��","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["ね瓁北��"]},{"op":63,"name":"test_turn","args":[1,0]},{"op":64,"name":"test_side","args":[0]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":119,"name":"int_var_op","args":[2,0,2,0,7]},{"op":120,"name":"data_transfer","args":[0,1,14,32]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":1,"offset":17085,"title":"ね瓁北��","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["ね瓁北��"]},{"op":63,"name":"test_turn","args":[3,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[80,1039]]},{"op":64,"name":"test_side","args":[0]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[1,65535,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[1,65535,1]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[1,65535,2]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[1,65535,3]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[1,65535,4]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[1,65535,5]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[1,65535,6]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[1,65535,7]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[1,65535,8]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[1,65535,9]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[1,65535,10]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[1,65535,11]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[1,65535,12]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[1,65535,13]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&姜维\n没想到秃发鲜卑会有这样的兵力，连我\n都小看他们了。\n&姜维\n不过纵然如此，他们也不是不能战胜的\n对手，众位随我去解救凉州残兵，并且\n将秃发鲜卑逐出凉州。\n&若罗拔能\n又来一批汉人？无妨，反正来一批杀一\n批。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[14,65535,2,0,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&马隆\n（姜维就算对敌人也毫不考虑伸出援手，\n他可真不是一般人。）\n&马隆\n（对比之下，邓艾曾经立下汗马功劳却\n被司马家弃如敝屣，我难道还要为那样\n的家族效力？）"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&句扶\n马隆…\n&姜维\n孝兴，你似乎想要做什么，对吧…\n&句扶\n我在想，这个叫马隆的是不是有这个价值\n，要让我们为他卖命。\n&句扶\n待会就让我试试他吧。"]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[80,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":2,"offset":17935,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":37,"name":"test_unit_at","args":[1025,10,18]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[20]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":61,"name":"get_item","args":[96,65535,1,1025]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[20,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":3,"offset":18016,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":37,"name":"test_unit_at","args":[1025,9,17]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[21]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":61,"name":"get_item","args":[89,65535,1,1025]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[21,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":4,"offset":18097,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":37,"name":"test_unit_at","args":[1025,17,5]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[22]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":61,"name":"get_item","args":[91,65535,1,1025]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[22,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":5,"offset":18178,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":37,"name":"test_unit_at","args":[1025,18,6]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[23]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":61,"name":"get_item","args":[88,65535,1,1025]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[23,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":6,"offset":18259,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":65,"name":"test_units_in_are